      "body": "{\n  \"job_id\": \"memory-constellation-operator-code-20260811-007\",\n  \"pillar\": \"E\",\n  \"action\": \"memory.constellation.verify-operator-code\",\n  \"source_ref\": \"c5e65e038b3b1290ca22e58046d19dce8c9003a4\"\n}\n\n## Canonical lifecycle disposition\n\n- Job 007 is a historical `BLOCKED` lifecycle receipt only; it is not execution proof and must not be promoted to `VERIFIED`.\n- Canonical allowlist repair: GlacierEQ/colossus-gateway commit `649951c3e9ec18e415a61f7e6b6eeffa21a8a84a`.\n- Audited allowlist receipt: `d3c3dd42-10b9-44a0-9320-00b827fab5b7`.\n- Workflow run: https://github.com/GlacierEQ/public-actions-runner-host/actions/runs/31531718598\n- Workflow job: `93913095772`.\n- Workload-token mint: `SUCCESS` under the then-current broker path.\n- Workload checkout: `FAILURE \u2014 Repository not found`.\n- Exact SHA binding: `SKIPPED`.\n- Adapter execution: `SKIPPED`.\n- Private lifecycle result: `SYNTHESIZED_BLOCKED_AND_PUBLISHED`.\n- Workload-token revocation: `SUCCESS`.\n- Control-token revocation: `SUCCESS`.\n\n## Superseded inference\n\nGitHub App installation `68484061` belongs to the ChatGPT GitHub connector and is not evidence that the Keymaster broker can access the workload repository. Any prior inference based on that installation is retired.\n\n## Controlling provider boundary\n\nThe Keymaster broker is bound to custom GitHub App installation `151808478` (app `4510813`). Its audited completed bootstrap session expected `GlacierEQ/constellation-memory-engine` but did not observe it. Therefore job 007's token mint does not establish usable workload-repository access; the checkout `Repository not found` result remains controlling.\n\nBroker v3 is canonicalized at GlacierEQ/colossus-gateway commit `4581d1b894ae4588c1e60f784db66fe35b51a857`. It now requires live repository-installation binding, single-repository token scoping, exact repository readback, and revocation before returning success.\n\n## Next execution gate\n\nDo not reuse job 007. Before dispatching another immutable verification job, establish that custom App installation `151808478` actually observes `GlacierEQ/constellation-memory-engine` through the broker's live binding/readback path. Only then execute a new job bound to the current PR head.",
